vEGPU Local Proxy
=================

This helper is a small vEGPU-specific TCP/UDP localhost forwarder.

Its forwarding model and provenance are based on GOST (GO Simple Tunnel):
https://github.com/ginuerzh/gost

GOST is MIT licensed. vEGPU keeps the GOST MIT license in this directory for
attribution and provenance. This helper intentionally includes only the local
TCP/UDP forwarding behavior vEGPU needs:

- no telemetry
- no analytics
- no updater
- no proxy chains
- no public bind
- no TLS tunnel
- no Shadowsocks
- no QUIC/KCP
- no DNS proxy
- no TUN/TAP
- no metrics or pprof endpoint

The helper binds localhost only and forwards only to the configured vEGPU VM
private address.
